      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "8. ( 1 )  A Data Fiduciary shall, irrespective of any agreement to the contrary or failure of a Data Principal to carry out the duties provided under this  Act, be responsible for complying with the provisions of this Act",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:161"
        },
        {
          "exactQuote": "For the purposes of this section, it is hereby clarified that a Data Principal shall be considered as not having approached the Data Fiduciary for the performance of the specified purpose, in any period during which she has not initiated contact with the Data Fiduciary for such performance, in person or by way of communication in electronic or physical form.",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:187"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": null,
      "type": "section"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_8_sub_1",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": "sec_8",
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "8. ( 1 )  A Data Fiduciary shall, irrespective of any agreement to the contrary or failure of a Data Principal to carry out the duties provided under this  Act, be responsible for complying with the provisions of this Act and the rules made thereunder in respect of any processing undertaken by it or on its behalf by a Data Processor.",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:161"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": null,
      "type": "subsection"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_8_sub_2",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": "sec_8",
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "( 2 )  A Data Fiduciary may engage, appoint, use or otherwise involve a Data Processor to  process  personal  data  on  its  behalf  for  any  activity  related  to  offering  of  goods  or services to Data Principals only under a valid contract.",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:162"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": null,
      "type": "subsection"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_8_sub_3",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": "sec_8",
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "( 3 ) Where personal data processed by a Data Fiduciary is likely to be-",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:163"
        },
        {
          "exactQuote": "the  Data  Fiduciary  processing  such  personal  data  shall  ensure  its  completeness, accuracy and consistency.",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:166"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": null,
      "type": "subsection"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_8_sub_3_cl_a",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": "sec_8_sub_3",
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "( a ) used to make a decision that affects the Data Principal; or",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:164"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": null,
      "type": "list-point"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_8_sub_3_cl_b",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": "sec_8_sub_3",
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "( b ) disclosed to another Data Fiduciary,",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:165"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": null,
      "type": "list-point"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_8_sub_4",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": "sec_8",
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "( 4 )  A Data Fiduciary shall implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure effective observance of  the provisions of this Act and the rules made thereunder.",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:167"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": null,
      "type": "subsection"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_8_sub_5",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": "sec_8",
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "( 5 )  A Data Fiduciary shall protect personal data in its possession or under its control, including in respect of any processing undertaken by it or on its behalf by a Data Processor, by taking reasonable security safeguards to prevent personal data breach.",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:168"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": null,
      "type": "subsection"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_8_sub_6",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": "sec_8",
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "( 6 ) In the event of a personal data breach, the Data Fiduciary shall give the Board and each affected Data Principal, intimation of such breach in such form and manner as may be prescribed.",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:169"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": null,
      "type": "subsection"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_8_sub_7",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": "sec_8",
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "( 7 )  A Data Fiduciary shall, unless retention is necessary for compliance with any law for the time being in force,-",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:170"
        },
        {
          "exactQuote": "( b ) cause its Data Processor to erase any personal data that was made available by the Data Fiduciary for processing to such Data Processor.",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:178"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": null,
      "type": "subsection"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_8_sub_7_cl_a",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": "sec_8_sub_7",
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "( a ) erase personal data, upon the Data Principal withdrawing her consent or as",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:171"
        },
        {
          "exactQuote": "soon as it  is  reasonable  to  assume  that  the  specified  purpose  is  no  longer  being served, whichever is earlier; and",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:177"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": null,
      "type": "list-point"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_8_sub_7_cl_b",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": "sec_8_sub_7",
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "( b ) cause its Data Processor to erase any personal data that was made available by the Data Fiduciary for processing to such Data Processor.",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:178"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": null,
      "type": "list-point"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_8_sub_7_illus_1",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": "sec_8_sub_7",
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "( I ) X, an individual, registers herself on an online marketplace operated by Y, an e-commerce service provider.",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:180"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": {
        "exactQuote": "Illustrations.",
        "occurrence": 0,
        "sourceId": "src:179"
      },
      "type": "illustration"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_8_sub_7_illus_2",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": "sec_8_sub_7",
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "( II ) X, an individual, decides to close her savings account with Y , a bank.",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:181"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": {
        "exactQuote": "Illustrations.",
        "occurrence": 0,
        "sourceId": "src:179"
      },
      "type": "illustration"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_8_sub_8",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": "sec_8",
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "( 8 ) The purpose referred to in clause ( a ) of sub-section ( 7 ) shall be deemed to no longer be served, if the Data Principal does not--",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:182"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": null,
      "type": "subsection"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_8_sub_8_cl_a",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": "sec_8_sub_8",
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "( a ) approach the Data Fiduciary for the performance of the specified purpose; and",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:183"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": null,
      "type": "list-point"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_8_sub_8_cl_b",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": "sec_8_sub_8",
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "( b ) exercise any of her rights in relation to such processing, for such time period as may be prescribed, and different time periods may be prescribed for different classes of Data Fiduciaries and for different purposes.",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:184"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": null,
      "type": "list-point"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_8_sub_9",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": "sec_8",
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "( 9 )  A Data Fiduciary shall publish, in such manner as may be prescribed, the business contact information of a Data Protection Officer, if applicable, or a person who is able to answer on behalf of the Data Fiduciary",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:185"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": null,
      "type": "subsection"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_8_sub_10",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": "sec_8",
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "( 10 ) A Data Fiduciary shall establish an effective mechanism to redress the grievances of Data Principals.",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:186"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": null,
      "type": "subsection"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_8_sub_11",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": "sec_8",
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "( 11 ) For the purposes of this section, it is hereby clarified that a Data Principal shall be considered as not having approached the Data Fiduciary for the performance of the specified purpose",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:187"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": null,
      "type": "subsection"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
      "codeAnchor": null,
      "id": "sec_9",
      "kind": "unit",
      "parent": null,
      "sourceAnchors": [
        {
          "exactQuote": "9. ( 1 ) The Data Fiduciary shall, before processing any personal data of a child or a person with disability who has a lawful guardian obtain verifiable consent of the parent of such child or the lawful guardian",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:188"
        },
        {
          "exactQuote": "Explanation. - For the purpose of this sub-section, the expression 'consent of the parent' includes the consent of lawful guardian, wherever applicable.",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "sourceId": "src:189"
        }
      ],
      "titleAnchor": null,
      "type": "section"
    },
    {
      "category": "provision",
